    "开发者是一名高中生（现在毕业了🎉🎉🎉），因为在学校里常年不知道Steam促销的信息而经常错过打折，于是写了这款软件，方便在学校里查看Steam的促销信息" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The developer is a high school student (now graduated 🎉🎉🎉), who often missed discounts because he didn't know about Steam promotions in school. So he wrote this software to make it easier to check Steam promotions in school."
          }
        }
      }
    },
